      },
      "worked": "$\\overline{A}\\cap\\overline{B}$ is the event that neither occurs.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(A\\cup B)&=1-0.2\\\\P(A\\cup B)&=0.8.\\end{align*}$$\nSince the events are mutually exclusive, $P(A)+P(B)=0.8$. Also $P(A)=3P(B)$, so $4P(B)=0.8$.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(B)&=\\frac{0.8}{4}\\\\P(B)&=0.2\\\\P(A)&=3(0.2)\\\\P(A)&=0.6.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
